-# Scenario V5.2 final hardening report
+# Scenario V5.2 complete-separation hardening report

 ## Verdict

-The research candidate passes PIT, probability-unit, explicit dependency-override, circularity, weight concentration, realism, cluster-label integrity, and 2027 distinctness gates. It is **not eligible for official/champion promotion** because the direct historical employment-event map has n=1 and the 0.60 dotcom setting is an aggressive single-cycle research override.
-
-## Core changes
-
-- July payroll actual/revisions and labor-market levels are normalized with source times and explicit units.
-- Full pre/post target-range distributions drive an independent policy-relief factor.
-- Growth-risk and policy-relief contributions remain separate and auditable.
-- S1 uses the dotcom expansion database cluster; S2 uses the modern general-market baseline cluster; S3 uses the macro tightening/financial-stress cluster.
-- Deterministic state-only assignments are frozen before cluster-level forward outcomes are used for labeling. Individual origins are never selected from future returns.
-- Main chart is total mixture; scenarios are immutable generator-conditional small multiples.
-- Realized event return is anchor-only; future jump and numerical event-return coefficient are zero.
-- The dotcom likelihood is S1-only (S1 0.60, S2 0.00, S3 0.00); the negative one-month target is retained.
-- A validated append-only CPI/NFP/FOMC/GDP/earnings ingestion boundary deterministically rebuilds the candidate and dashboard.
+The candidate passes PIT, fraction units, dependency caps, circularity, independent episode/residual provenance, variable-duration repetition, no-fake-wiggle, and preregistered baseline-reduction checks. It is **not official and not champion**. Direct employment events remain 1/60, band calibration is 6/60, at least one origin minimum and the S2/S3 kernel gates remain open, and walk-forward/human approval are absent.

 ## Quantitative outcome

-Full-evidence probabilities are S1 79.52%, S2 14.70%, and S3 5.78%. Conditional 2027 terminal p50 levels are S1 37,161.84, S2 34,121.14, and S3 13,163.70.
-
-## Hashes
-
-- Candidate model: `5ae4dfe981712b35f97b01b023b1e64138cf7adc9a4ebfb34a5b4565afcf5846`
-- Receipt: `b6352266ec4d95c83e9a72c4936998c59a8cfdcb2f5815696d77384e5a875e36`
