+# V5.2 call graph and coordinate audit
+
+- `build_clustered_prior` freezes state-feature k-medoids assignments before cluster outcomes are read.
+- S1/S2/S3 use separate phase samplers, mutually exclusive macro origin sets, block provenance, and RNG streams.
+- A changes post-generation likelihood, B changes S1 block provenance, and C is derived by `build_weights`.
